<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CapStar Hotel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CapStar Hotel started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it started CapStar Hotel Investors Inc with a moderate outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/8 at 17-5/8.</p>
